SECURITY-ROTATION-CHECKLIST.md

# Seeder reference data. The uncompressed sources total ~335 MB and
# india_natural_water_only.geojson alone exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit,
# so only the gzipped copies are tracked - every deployment can then seed itself
# straight from the repo. Compression is lossless and applied at the source's
# own precision, so `gunzip -c x.gz | diff - x` is empty.
# Re-compress with: gzip -9 -c <file> > <file>.gz
/backend/src/seeder/data/*
!/backend/src/seeder/data/*.gz
# Purchased or web-scraped data we may not republish. Keep local copies only;
# see DATA_SOURCES.md for loading your own.
/backend/src/seeder/data/list-of-poultry-farms-in-india.csv.gz
/backend/src/seeder/data/cattle-market.csv.gz
# Folder mounted into the backend container for data you supply yourself.
# Only its README and the example files are tracked.
/geolens-data/*
!/geolens-data/README.md
!/geolens-data/*.example.csv
# Local reference copies only. The app no longer reads either file (poultry
# farms now come from the GeoLens API), and we may not republish them.
/web/public/data/poultry-farms.json
/web/public/maps/india_wetland_boundaries.geojson

.vscode
docs/superpowers
docs/dpg
.env.prod